sequenceDiagram
    participant Services as Domain Services
    participant EB as EventBridge
    participant GAL as Governance, Audit Trail & Lineage
    participant UAO as Usage Analytics & Operational Insights
    participant S3 as S3 Projections
    participant Athena as Athena
    participant QS as QuickSight
    participant Leadership as IA Leadership

    Services->>EB: Emit Telemetry Events (e.g., TimeSpent, Revisions)
    EB->>GAL: Stream to Audit Trail
    GAL->>S3: Project Events to Optimized Store (Aggregations)
    UAO->>Athena: Query Projections (e.g., Bottlenecks by Section)
    Athena-->>UAO: Return Aggregated Metrics (e.g., Avg Time per Stage)
    UAO->>QS: Update Dashboards (KPIs: Rework Cycles, AI Adoption)
    QS-->>Leadership: View Insights (e.g., Methodology Effectiveness)